magamistuppa, usu, ma saadan kohe.

83
00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.010
No.

84
00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.459
Asukale naisterahvale ei ole lubatud
passmehe magamistuppa minna,

85
00:08:41.559 --> 00:08:45.190
mis on lubatud viisakale
naisterahvale.

86
00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:48.580
Rumaluseevakene, mine, mine,
ma palusin, mine.

87
00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.200
Ma siis.

88
00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.220
Paul.

89
00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.310
Paul, palun tata kohe ära.

90
00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.810
Ja.

91
00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:04.440
Ja ja, ja.

92
00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:07.510
Ja ja, ja, ja ma tulen.

93
00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.745
Sa oled sina isa.

94
00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.829
Väga.

95
00:09:18.929 --> 00:09:21.379
Ootamatu näha jää.

96
00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:35.770
No.

97
00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:39.130
Kus ta ise on, siis ma ei saa aru,
mis sa mõtled, ei saa, ma mõtlen,

98
00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:42.490
