Vanasti aitasid sa ju ema alati.

185
00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.330
V. Ivo.

186
00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:32.200
Eva tee lahti,
paneme selleks kööki eba.

187
00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:10.740
Kuidas ma suudaksin sinusugust
inglit maha jätta?

188
00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.680
Vanamehel on kindlasti mõni rasvane
hani kaalul aga

189
00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.905
